{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"以赛亚书","commonName":"以赛亚书","title":"以赛亚书","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"041bfa209c1bd8138686a87c00c5325476bd6721f47866508098b9a4f8ea9feb","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1290},"chapter":{"number":9,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["但那受过痛苦的必不再见幽暗。 未来的君王 从前 神使西布伦地和拿弗他利地被藐视，末后却使这沿海的路，约旦河外，外邦人的加利利地得着荣耀。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"text":"在黑暗中行走的百姓看见了大光；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"住在死荫之地的人有光照耀他们。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你使这国民繁多，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"加增他们的喜乐；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们在你面前欢喜，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好像收割的欢喜，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像人分掳物那样的快乐。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为他们所负的重轭","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"和肩头上的杖，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"并欺压他们人的棍，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你都已经折断，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好像在米甸的日子一样。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"战士在乱杀之间所穿戴的盔甲，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"并那滚在血中的衣服，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"都必作为可烧的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"当作火柴。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因有一婴孩为我们而生；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有一子赐给我们。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"政权必担在他的肩头上；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他名称为「奇妙策士、全能的 神、永在的父、和平的君」。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他的政权与平安必加增无穷。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他必在大卫的宝座上治理他的国，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以公平公义使国坚定稳固，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"从今直到永远。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"万军之耶和华的热心必成就这事。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"heading","content":["耶和华要惩罚以色列"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"主使一言入于雅各家，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"落于以色列家。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这众百姓，就是以法莲","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"和撒马利亚的居民，都要知道；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们凭骄傲自大的心说：","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"砖墙塌了，我们却要凿石头建筑；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"桑树砍了，我们却要换香柏树。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，耶和华要高举利汛的敌人","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"来攻击以色列，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"并要激动以色列的仇敌。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"东有亚兰人，西有非利士人；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们张口要吞吃以色列。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"虽然如此，耶和华的怒气还未转消；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他的手仍伸不缩。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"text":"这百姓还没有归向击打他们的主，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也没有寻求万军之耶和华。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，耶和华一日之间","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必从以色列中剪除头与尾，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"棕枝与芦苇—","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"长老和尊贵人就是头，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以谎言教人的先知就是尾。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为，引导这百姓的使他们走错了路；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被引导的都必败亡。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以，主必不喜悦他们的少年人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不怜恤他们的孤儿寡妇；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为，各人是亵渎的，是行恶的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"并且各人的口都说愚妄的话。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"虽然如此，耶和华的怒气还未转消；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他的手仍伸不缩。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"text":"邪恶像火焚烧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"烧灭荆棘和蒺藜，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在稠密的树林中着起来，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就成为烟柱，旋转上腾。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因万军之耶和华的烈怒，地都烧遍；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"百姓成为火柴；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"无人怜爱弟兄。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有人右边抢夺，仍受饥饿，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"左边吞吃，仍不饱足；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"各人吃自己膀臂上的肉。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"玛拿西吞吃","poem":1},{"noteId":7},{"text":"以法莲；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以法莲吞吃玛拿西，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又一同攻击犹大。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"虽然如此，耶和华的怒气还未转消；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他的手仍伸不缩。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":7,"caller":"-","text":"或译：攻击；下同","reference":{"chapter":9,"verse":21}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/9.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/10.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/8.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":21}